{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-01-03T15:13:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1742564962390909256"],"id":"1742564962390909256","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":67,"impression_count":71482,"like_count":119,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":8},"text":"好多人说我那个日本风俗百科文章太繁琐看不过来，我把导航加上了，按照需要去检索吧。 https://t.co/Bm6gNZgWNB","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1742564962390909256"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-01-03T14:01:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1742546766258446475"],"id":"1742546766258446475","note_tweet":{"text":"前几天圈子里有个客人要去泡泡浴，就喊了客服帮他约了家店自己去了。\n120分钟套餐，玩到最后觉得不对劲，就给我客服打电话说，怎么只按摩不打炮？客服也蒙了，就问姑娘在不在你身边，你让那姑娘接电话。\n姑娘接过电话就说，本来是打炮挺轻松的活，结果硬生生按摩两小时累够呛。，期间不断问这客人五遍要不要打炮，客人一直说nonono...\n然后问客人为啥一直no，客人说以为是啥加价项目，就一直说no...\n\n结果俩人光着身子在屋里按摩按了两个小时...\n所以，去泡泡浴，还是了解点日语好..."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":42,"impression_count":185785,"like_count":169,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":9},"text":"前几天圈子里有个客人要去泡泡浴，就喊了客服帮他约了家店自己去了。\n120分钟套餐，玩到最后觉得不对劲，就给我客服打电话说，怎么只按摩不打炮？客服也蒙了，就问姑娘在不在你身边，你让那姑娘接电话。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1742546766258446475"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-01-03T07:38:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1742450335824887909"],"id":"1742450335824887909","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":51359,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我快住在雪场了... https://t.co/W8wAGWmSNX","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1742450335824887909"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-01-02T07:52:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1742091464145051986"],"id":"1742091464145051986","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":69473,"like_count":105,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"新年新气象 https://t.co/4irukUIqf0","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1742091464145051986"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-01-01T18:58:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1741896740096401580"],"id":"1741896740096401580","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":82896,"like_count":66,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1741837506109198336","type":"quoted"}],"text":"人道主义光辉 https://t.co/XSP6uhh1fc","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1741896740096401580"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2024-01-01T13:11:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1741809361721426057"],"id":"1741809361721426057","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":43402,"like_count":36,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"国内这地震报道，我真的是服了...\n给人感觉整个日本都要沉了...\n结果在东京完全没感觉震感的我，\n听到地震的消息一脸茫然...\n我在家美滋滋看电视剧呢，\n一时没注意手机所有的人都在问我日本地震你有没有事...","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1741809361721426057"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-31T16:16:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1741493464196591672"],"id":"1741493464196591672","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":44266,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"初詣 https://t.co/tyn14hq8Zl","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1741493464196591672"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-31T13:13:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1741447426370925023"],"id":"1741447426370925023","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":51003,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我的2023，大家新年快乐 https://t.co/VVQNesjx64","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1741447426370925023"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-31T12:42:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1741439720289337345"],"id":"1741439720289337345","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":47819,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"新年快乐 https://t.co/mqQyJPFKBf","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1741439720289337345"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-31T05:28:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1741330576446210189"],"id":"1741330576446210189","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":24,"impression_count":78109,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我一直强调，只想玩泡泡浴的不要加我的圈子，因为圈子的内容真的不适合你...\n你加圈子的这钱就足够在泡泡浴玩的挺好了。\n对于那些只想去泡泡浴的，其实可以去找那种专门带吉原泡泡浴的中介，给他们几千人民币带路费他们就能带你去。 https://t.co/211Ar9bS5D","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1741330576446210189"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-30T04:50:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1740958571347747216"],"id":"1740958571347747216","note_tweet":{"text":"好多人发私信给我想让我教他们搞黄色...\n还有好多想来我这边工作上班的...\n\n说实话，在日本单纯的靠搞黄色真的不是一个赚钱的行业，真的赚钱的则是通过搞黄色而积累起来的人脉关系之间的相互运作。\n\n来找我的，真的是各行各业的都有，毕竟是人类刚需。而且由于我门槛卡的高，就能保证来找我的基本都是某个行业的头部人物。\n\n有了这些人脉资源，你随便用信息差互相之间一介绍，拼个缝赚一次的钱就比你搞一年黄色赚的都多...\n最主要的是这种通过搞黄色建立起的信任感，可是你无论处多少年关系都达不到的，因此这些生意的成单率都是出奇的高。\n\n再加上我跟所有人做生意都不明确点位，都是让各家看着给就行...\n然后得的往往比定点位得的还要多...真有那种不给的，也不会去计较，以后不合作就是了...任何事情都不如我有一个好心情重要。\n\n如果连这个认知都没有的话，我只能说你还不适合搞黄色..."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":89,"impression_count":204829,"like_count":147,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":12},"text":"好多人发私信给我想让我教他们搞黄色...\n还有好多想来我这边工作上班的...\n\n说实话，在日本单纯的靠搞黄色真的不是一个赚钱的行业，真的赚钱的则是通过搞黄色而积累起来的人脉关系之间的相互运作。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1740958571347747216"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-29T05:46:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1740610197578793246"],"id":"1740610197578793246","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":42771,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今年のスノーボ、始まる https://t.co/cBlT4CSFzX","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1740610197578793246"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-28T13:04:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1740357974814794098"],"id":"1740357974814794098","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":52233,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"贤者时间 https://t.co/FfFhchNpif","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1740357974814794098"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-28T04:01:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1740221422285541879"],"id":"1740221422285541879","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":108272,"like_count":84,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1740213479393710528","type":"quoted"}],"text":"最骚的是，她跟我说，我要不帮她介绍，她就要去亲自去陪了... https://t.co/qQuZUxjtOK","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1740221422285541879"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-28T03:29:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1740213479393710528"],"id":"1740213479393710528","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":38,"impression_count":227995,"like_count":204,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":20},"text":"刚刚一个小仙女找我，让我帮她给她的客人安排女优。\n她微博是各种女权，把这帮喷的是体无完肤...\n我说你咋拉上皮条了？你不是最痛恨这个吗？\n然后他就说哎呀，都是客户，身不由己巴拉巴拉的...\n帮她联系好，报了价，她突然问我我是不是可以加点钱？\n骂男人骂的专业，没想到拉皮条的商业思维也很足嘛...","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1740213479393710528"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-27T04:00:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1739858833261129978"],"id":"1739858833261129978","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":132624,"like_count":171,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":16},"text":"日本男人列举的泡泡浴和结婚的优缺点对比，\n所以为什么知道为什么我国禁黄了吗... https://t.co/D3RosPjTWf","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1739858833261129978"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-27T03:40:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1739853705518997940"],"id":"1739853705518997940","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43452,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今年算是忙完了，放个几天假吧。 https://t.co/Q6OccaDIBr","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1739853705518997940"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-26T07:25:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1739548015617343892"],"id":"1739548015617343892","note_tweet":{"text":"歌舞伎町扫黄就是把那些站街的给扫掉了，把男公关店和一些コンカフェ给整掉了。\n但是没有钱的女孩子，出来卖的女孩子数量依然没有减少反而有增加的趋势。\n但跟之前不同的是，她们的获客渠道被极大的压缩，之前可以通过线下斡旋去讨论价格，如今也只能通过线上DM去进行沟通。\n然而这个虚拟环境下存在着很多骗子、冷やかし、钓鱼执法。很多要高价的女孩子，被一些没钱的日本大叔看到，就想在DM里搞她们。\n因此很多高价援交被处处针对，与此同时，她们的欠款，信用卡借款还是一分不少的需要她们去偿还，因此他们只能在线上降低自己身价去接客人。\n这一波清理运动成就了一批マーチングアプリ，前几天看了一个APP，匹配率暴涨..."},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":79190,"like_count":32,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1739512974828810505","type":"quoted"}],"text":"歌舞伎町扫黄就是把那些站街的给扫掉了，把男公关店和一些コンカフェ给整掉了。\n但是没有钱的女孩子，出来卖的女孩子数量依然没有减少反而有增加的趋势。\n但跟之前不同的是，她们的获客渠道被极大的压缩，之前可以通过线下斡旋去讨论价格，如今也只能通过线上DM去进行沟通。 https://t.co/fmZNLPS5BW","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1739548015617343892"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-26T05:06:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1739512974828810505"],"id":"1739512974828810505","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":170627,"like_count":64,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":2},"text":"你别说，自从歌舞伎町扫黄作业开展以来，援交价格明显被打下来了...","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1739512974828810505"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-26T03:51:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1739494225237234064"],"id":"1739494225237234064","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":57063,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1739297522831827001","type":"quoted"}],"text":"圣诞夜喊来的圣诞老人...😂😂😂 https://t.co/Bc5N5YbuIG","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1739494225237234064"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-25T17:51:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1739343102152970421"],"id":"1739343102152970421","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":59074,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1738950706332340336","type":"quoted"}],"text":"他好像感觉警察很重视... https://t.co/NEYaItFL0U","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1739343102152970421"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2023-12-25T06:49:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1739176408403067377"],"id":"1739176408403067377","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":5901